WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.333
Hey, um, 2017 kinda got away from me 

00:00:02.333 --> 00:00:04.416
but this is the year I really want to get in shape

00:00:04.416 --> 00:00:07.208
You came to the right place.
First thing, what's your diet been like lately?

00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:08.958
I mean, I've only been eating W's

00:00:08.958 --> 00:00:11.166
Well, sometimes I'll have an L before bed

00:00:11.166 --> 00:00:13.625
Maybe in the morning, or during primetime

00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:16.541
OK, sign here and wait with all the other eliminated players

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:18.875
Who decided to join a gym on Jan. 2

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:21.125
I'm gonna make some changes in 2018

00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:22.333
Yeah, we're gonna make some changes too

00:00:25.119 --> 00:00:26.875
This is where all the cardio goes down

00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:28.916
How does this work? They really expect
me to move my feet?

00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:30.326
God damn newbies

00:00:30.326 --> 00:00:32.792
"OK, I give up"

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:34.579
Over here, we have a bunch of giant tires.

00:00:34.579 --> 00:00:37.577
Terrible for your back, but great for Instagram.

00:00:37.577 --> 00:00:39.708
This is our media spin class.

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:41.488
Repeat after me: I blame my quarterback.

00:00:41.488 --> 00:00:42.791
I blame my offensive line, 
I blame my defensive coordinator.

00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:43.883
I blame Jameis.

00:00:43.883 --> 00:00:46.416
This is our spa and wellness area. Perfect for rehab.

00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:48.333
Ooh, these Jets are okay.

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:51.238
Ah, the Jets are actually too inconsistent. Aaaaah!!

00:00:51.238 --> 00:00:53.041
You got free weights, your cable machines

00:00:53.041 --> 00:00:54.333
and of course, bench press.

00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:55.083
Higher!!!

00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:57.458
Woo! I'm in, let's get started

00:00:57.458 --> 00:00:58.125
Ow!

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:00.040
I hate the gym in January

